<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n37262" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Postŭmĭus</span></b>  (erroneously writt.
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Post-hŭmĭus</span></b> ; v. postumus, under posterus,
		III. B.), i, m.; <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Postŭmia</span></b> , ae, f.,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>name of a
			Roman</i> gens. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			Postumius Tubertus, <i>a Roman consul</i>, <i><span class="en">Liv. 2,
			16</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			Postumia, <i>wife of Sulpicius</i>, <i><span class="en">Cic. Fam. 4,
				2, 1</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>III.</b>
			<i>A Vestal</i>, <i><span class="en">Liv. 4,
			44</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>IV.</b>
			<i>A woman addicted to tippling</i>, <i><span class="en">Cat. 27,
			3</span></i>.—Hence, </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>A.</b>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Po-stŭmĭus</span></b> , a, um,
				adj., <i>Postumian</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">lex,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					14, 12, 14, § 88</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">via,</span>”
				<i>leading towards Genoa</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Tac. H.
					3, 21</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Postŭmĭā-nus</span></b> , a,
				um, adj., <i>of</i> or <i>belonging to a Postumius</i>, <i>Postumian</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">imperia,</span>”
				i. e. <i>of the dictator A. Postumius Tubertus</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Gell.
					1, 13, 7</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Liv. 4, 29</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">caedes,</span>”
				i. e. <i>of M. Postumius Regillensis</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">id. 4,
					51</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
